[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0010","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0020","text":"……哦，在看照片吗\n是之前那场演出的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0030","text":"对！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0040","text":"照片好多，看着特别开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0050","text":"你看你看，这张！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0060","text":"跳跃的姿势已经完全是“啦啦队队长”了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0070","text":"哈哈，确实"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0080","text":"要是再拿着彩球就完美了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0090","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0100","text":"不错不错，彩球！\n拿着跳舞一定很开心！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20300200_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
